<title>FRANCE: Algeria buys 75,000 tonnes French soft wheat-trade.</title>
<headline>Algeria buys 75,000 tonnes French soft wheat-trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria bought on Tuesday 75,000 tonnes of French soft wheat under a Coface-guaranteed export credit at $150 per tonne, Fob, European grain traders said.  </p>
<p>One exporter said Algeria might be negotiating the purchase of another wheat cargo.</p>
<p>Algeria bought at the tender 50,000 tonnes of French soft wheat for shipment between February 25 and March 10 and another 25,000 tonnes for shipment in the first half of March, exporters said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
